{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 100,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        186.8113250732422,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        107.56733703613281,
        512.5443115234375,
        120.48133850097656
      ],
      "text": "13.\tFor persons with a sputum smear-positive specimen or a cultured isolate of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        123.06733703613281,
        512.47705078125,
        135.98133850097656
      ],
      "text": "MTBC, commercial molecular LPAs may be used as the initial test instead of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        138.5673370361328,
        512.3999633789062,
        151.48133850097656
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic culture-based DST to detect resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        156.9349365234375,
        509.613037109375,
        169.81593322753906
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, moderate certainty in the evidence for the test’s accuracy)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 10.945012092590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        192.247802734375,
        120.02171325683594,
        206.33580017089844
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.0386962890625,
        526.8802490234375,
        230.18370056152344
      ],
      "text": "1.\t  These recommendations apply to the use of LPAs for testing sputum smear-positive specimens",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        232.5386962890625,
        526.9641723632812,
        245.68370056152344
      ],
      "text": "(direct testing) and cultured isolates of MTBC (indirect testing) from both pulmonary and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        248.0386962890625,
        190.1320037841797,
        261.1837158203125
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary sites.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.042724609375,
        511.9320068359375,
        285.187744140625
      ],
      "text": "2.\t LPAs are not recommended for the direct testing of sputum smear-negative specimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.046630859375,
        526.9423217773438,
        309.191650390625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t These recommendations apply to the detection of MTBC and the diagnosis of MDR-TB, but",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        311.546630859375,
        526.9641723632812,
        324.691650390625
      ],
      "text": "acknowledge that the accuracy of detecting resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid differs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        327.0466003417969,
        444.61309814453125,
        340.1916198730469
      ],
      "text": "and, hence, that the accuracy of a diagnosis of MDR-TB is reduced overall.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.0505065917969,
        526.6231689453125,
        364.1955261230469
      ],
      "text": "4.\t These recommendations do not eliminate the need for conventional culture-based DST,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        366.5505065917969,
        526.964111328125,
        379.6955261230469
      ],
      "text": "which will be necessary to determine resistance to other anti-TB agents and to monitor the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        382.0505065917969,
        285.7978820800781,
        395.1955261230469
      ],
      "text": "emergence of additional drug resistance.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.0544128417969,
        527.2640380859375,
        419.1994323730469
      ],
      "text": "5.\t  Conventional culture-based DST for isoniazid may still be used to evaluate patients when the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        421.5544128417969,
        527.05615234375,
        434.6994323730469
      ],
      "text": "LPA result does not detect isoniazid resistance. This is particularly important for populations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983386993408203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        437.0544128417969,
        359.077880859375,
        450.1994323730469
      ],
      "text": "with a high pretest probability of resistance to isoniazid.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.05841064453125,
        526.9531860351562,
        474.20343017578125
      ],
      "text": "6.\t These recommendations apply to the use of LPA in children based on the generalization of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        476.55841064453125,
        169.03469848632812,
        489.70343017578125
      ],
      "text": "data from adults.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.0700378417969,
        173.49029541015625,
        518.4500122070312
      ],
      "text": "Test description",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.700927734375,
        526.8161010742188,
        541.845947265625
      ],
      "text": "LPAs are a family of DNA strip-based tests that can detect the MTBC strain and determine its drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977375984191895,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.200927734375,
        527.27490234375,
        557.345947265625
      ],
      "text": "resistance profile through the pattern of binding of amplicons (DNA amplification products)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.700927734375,
        526.699462890625,
        572.845947265625
      ],
      "text": "to probes targeting the following: specific parts of the MTBC genome (for MTBC detection),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.200927734375,
        526.9678955078125,
        588.345947265625
      ],
      "text": "the most common resistance-associated mutations to first-line and second-line agents, or the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.700927734375,
        499.6273193359375,
        603.845947265625
      ],
      "text": "corresponding wild-type DNA sequence (for detection of resistance to anti-TB drugs)  . (38)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.704833984375,
        526.9810180664062,
        627.849853515625
      ],
      "text": "LPAs are based on reverse hybridization DNA strip technology and involve three steps: DNA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.204833984375,
        526.991455078125,
        643.349853515625
      ],
      "text": "extraction from   culture isolates or directly from patient specimens, followed  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.704833984375,
        526.9667358398438,
        658.849853515625
      ],
      "text": "by multiplex PCR amplification and then reverse hybridization with visualization of amplicon",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.204833984375,
        376.2867126464844,
        674.349853515625
      ],
      "text": "binding (or lack thereof) to wild-type and mutation probes  . (8)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.2088012695312,
        527.004638671875,
        698.3538208007812
      ],
      "text": "Although LPAs are more technically complex to perform than the Xpert MTB/RIF assay, they can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.7088012695312,
        526.6876220703125,
        713.8538208007812
      ],
      "text": "detect isoniazid resistance. Testing platforms have been designed for a reference laboratory setting",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.892020225524902,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        716.2088012695312,
        512.3935546875,
        729.3538208007812
      ],
      "text": "and are thus most applicable to high TB burden countries. Results can be obtained in 5 hours.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "84 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}